// Package slice makes slices (docs/spec/stdlib.md, Slices and Maps). The
// Go body is runtime/v1's WithCapacity.

// WithCapacity is an empty slice with room for n elements. It makes no
// element; a negative n is a defect, as Go's make panics.
extern go ergo.local/prototype/runtime/v1.WithCapacity func WithCapacity[T](n int) []T
